  "$comment": "Orochia's default avatars and banners — the data the picker, the preset route and the profile API read. Files live in the product's storage zone (public/defaults/…) and are served by /defaults/…; ids are the file names. A new picture is added here AND in scripts/dev-dataset/profile-media-v2.json (its generation spec), never in a component. Avatars: <id>-256.webp and <id>-512.webp. Banners: 3:1 (or 4:1 for the first batch), <id>.webp at 1600, plus <id>-800.webp when `widths` says so.",
